                "end_index": 2794,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "### Crucial Safety Warning: Avoid \"Double-Dosing\"\nMany popular over-the-counter cold remedies are **multi-symptom formulas** (e.g., NyQuil, DayQuil, Tylenol Cold & Flu)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
