                "part_index": null,
                "text": "### When to See a Doctor\nWhile a cold usually goes away on its own within 7 to 10 days, you should seek professional medical attention if you experience any of the following \"red flag\" symptoms:\n*   Difficulty breathing, shortness of breath, or chest pain"
